{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/5c54a3833132e91797c84129cc7af390.avif?t=1761908150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras_big/5c54a3833132e91797c84129cc7af390.avif?t=1761908150 width=1560 height=974 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6a2ffa9d5becad43a39b884493f14242.avif?t=1761908150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras_big/6a2ffa9d5becad43a39b884493f14242.avif?t=1761908150 width=1560 height=974 /></span><br><br><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645650?t=1761908150","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645650?t=1761908150","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/11069b0eac34c1ea2ef0e73bba2cf9b99ba17e26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761908150","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/11069b0eac34c1ea2ef0e73bba2cf9b99ba17e26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761908150","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains the following content that may not be appropriate for all ages:\r\n\r\nViolence: Includes shooting animations and depictions of blood.\r\n\r\nHorror Elements: Contains sudden loud noises, jump scares, and disturbing imagery."},"demos":[{"appid":3664830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/5c54a3833132e91797c84129cc7af390.avif?t=1761908150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras_big/5c54a3833132e91797c84129cc7af390.avif?t=1761908150 width=1560 height=974 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6a2ffa9d5becad43a39b884493f14242.avif?t=1761908150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras_big/6a2ffa9d5becad43a39b884493f14242.avif?t=1761908150 width=1560 height=974 /></span><br><br><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Robert Rigopoulos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/f5656cfeb98dd38e0a7ef42611f791e0dc5fb5ee/header.jpg?t=1761908150","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3645650/87350944/c37a406239039ce3dd1e34d47408b555b5b572df/1761872550/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761873069","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3645650/87350944/c37a406239039ce3dd1e34d47408b555b5b572df/1761872550/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761873069","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3645650/87350944/c37a406239039ce3dd1e34d47408b555b5b572df/1761872550/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761873069","id":257131083,"mp4":{"480":"http